# 🛡️ AsohCloak — Authentication & Authorization API

> **AsohCloak** is a Spring Boot REST API built to master production-grade **Authentication and Role-Based Authorization** using **Keycloak** as the sole identity provider. School Management features are planned as a second phase on top of this security foundation. 🎓

